# A missing key names the command that installs it, and never blames a
# spent key.
expect kobo secret set openai
expect-missing The key may be wrong or spent
clean
shot no-key
# A conversation with nothing in it says which key it needs before anything
# is typed, for whichever service is chosen.
tap more
tap New conversation
tap Start over
wait-for Nothing said yet
expect This uses your own OpenAI key
expect kobo secret set openai
clean
shot first-run-key
tap Service
tap Anthropic
